abstract: >-
  Derived aggregate records, source locators and deterministic verification for a
  closed secondary analysis of the Kaissar QML-IDS corpus. Twenty-one articles are
  included; five supply 24 main descriptive points. No new model training or QPU
  executions. Conditional binomial calculations are distinguished from verified
  sampling or calibration guarantees. Code is MIT; derived data/documentation are
  CC BY 4.0 under the scopes in LICENSING.txt. The companion manuscript is not yet submitted or published.
keywords:
  - quantum machine learning
  - intrusion detection
  - false-positive rate
  - meta-research
  - reproducibility
